# Paste a token from POST /api/users/auth/login (never commit real tokens)
@token = PASTE_YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### Get All Users
GET http://localhost:3000/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Single User 
GET http://localhost:3000/api/users/current-user
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Register
POST http://localhost:3000/api/users/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email" : "Sonic@gmail.com",
  "password" : "Sonic123",
  "username" : "Shohber"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:3000/api/users/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "Sonic@gmail.com",
  "password" : "Sonic123"
}

###
GET  http://localhost:3000/api/users/images/1788291888688-970117185-WhatsApp Image 2025-11-26 at 4.56.10 PM.jpeg
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Reset Password
GET http://localhost:3000/api/users/reset-password/1/PASTE_TOKEN_FROM_EMAIL
